---
description: Always follow apps/web design system for any UI work
alwaysApply: true
---

Before generating or modifying any UI:

1. Read `DESIGN.md` and treat `apps/web/` as the only frontend (css/common.css, css/app.css, the three HTML pages).
2. Follow its guidance on colors, typography, spacing, layout, components, and animations.
3. Reuse existing components and design tokens whenever possible.
4. Do not introduce a second theme or create another frontend directory.

After completing the task, verify the result matches the dark glass look in `apps/web`.
